# Enter the development shell of shell.nix when entering this directory.
#
# The shell provides the CUDA runtime libraries the GLiNER resolver needs
# when the daemon is built with `--features gliner-cuda`. Without CUDA the
# model still runs on the processor, so the shell is optional.
#
#   direnv allow
#
# Run `nix-shell --arg cuda false` for a shell without CUDA.
use nix
